window.products.push({"id":100041,"name":"Samsung Dishwasher Mounting Bracket DD94-01002A Dishwasher Assembly-install Kit Replacement #DD94-01002A AP4450818 DW80K5050US PS4222710 - Diy eTips I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oxVaPy2AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 DD94-01002A Dishwasher Installation Bracket - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4450818, 2077601, PS4222710. Separate dishwasher from its power before the installation. Dd94-01002a Assembly-install Kit by PartsBroz is compatible with Samsung dishwasher. It is important to note that this kit is designed specifically for Samsung dishwashers and may not be compatible with other dishwasher brands or models. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Samsung Dishwasher Mounting Bracket Replacement #dd94-01002a? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Dd94-01002a Dishwasher Assembly-install Kit will help if any piece of the previous installation kit breaks or disappears. Replace it to protect your kitchen. 💡 The DD94-01002A dishwasher installation kit does include a mounting bracket that is designed to securely attach the dishwasher to the underside of the countertop or to the side of the adjacent cabinet. The mounting bracket is an essential component of the installation process and helps to prevent the dishwasher from tipping or shifting during use. Our dishwasher mounting kit meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Does dishwasher need mounting bracket? Yes, in most cases, a dishwasher needs a mounting bracket for proper installation. A mounting bracket is typically used to secure the dishwasher to the underside of the countertop or to the side of the adjacent cabinet to prevent it from tipping forward or shifting during use. The specific type of mounting bracket required will depend on the model of the dishwasher and the type of countertop or cabinet it is being installed under. 💡 Compatible Models: dmr57lfbxaa, dmr57lfsxaa, dmr57lfwxaa, dmr77lhb, dmr77lhbxaa, dmr77lhsxaa, dmr77lhwxaa, dmr78ahbxaa, dmr78ahs, dmr78ahs/xaa, dmr78ahsxaa, dmr78ahwxaa, dmt610rhb, dmt610rhw, dw7933lrabbaa, dw7933lrasraa, dw7933lrawwaa, dw7933lrawwac, dw80f600utb, dw80f600uts, dw80f600utw, dw80f800uws, dw80j3020ub, dw80j3020us, dw80j3020uw, dw80k5050ub, dw80k5050ug, dw80k5050us, dw80k5050uw, dw80k7050ug, dw80k7050us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oxVaPy2AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07P5JY7ND","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P5JY7ND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P5JY7ND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":100042,"name":"Livtor W10913953 Washer Shift Actuator Compatible with Whirl-pool, Kenmore, Maytag, Amana Washing Machines Replacement for W10913953VP, W10597177, WPW","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514VM9Lv6mL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE COMPATIBILITY: Livtor W10913953 washer actuator is compatible with Whirlpool, Kenmore, Amana and other top washer brands; replacement for W10913953VP W10597277 WPW10597177 AP6037270 PS11769864 W10815026; NOTE that please check and confirm the model compatible with your washer before ordering! GOOD EFFECT & GREAT PERFORMANCE: The W10913953 shift actuator can fix the following issues, like 1)it doesn't go into the final spin, getting stuck in the cycle,2) it stops agitating, 3) it has sensing error, 4) it spins slowly; after fixing the problems with the W10913953 washer shift actuator, it will bring your washer back to life! It is recommended to run your washer self-diagnostic mode and find the error code before replacing the actuator. EASY TO INSTALL: Remove the hose, tip the washer over to lay it flat on its back, remove the plastic basket, unplug the actuator, unscrew 2 screws holding the actuator in place, put the new one on, flip the washer back over and done! very simple to install in several minutes, your washer will be back up and run normally. PLEASE remember to unplug the washer and turn off the water source! MONEY SAVER: DIY it in some minutes, just forgetting to call the professional technician or appliance repairman to come out, you do not need to buy a new washing machine, saving you hundreds of bucks! GOOD ADDITION TO YOUR WASHER: The W10913953 wahshing machine actuator has an optic sensor to shift the transmission from agitation to spin mode; if it is failed, your washer will not complete the wash cycle, soaking wet clothes; the actuator is designed for resolving the problems to make you enjoy easy life. A great solution to fix your washer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514VM9Lv6mL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Livtor","source_asin":"B09B3DCRS9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3DCRS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3DCRS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
