window.products.push({"id":100133,"name":"LemoHome Portable Countertop Dishwasher,4 Washing Programs, Air-Dry Function and LED Light for Small Apartments, Dorms and RVs (Golden)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hv6mgwnVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤【5 WORKING PROGRAMS】This dishwasher has 5 working programs: fast washing (30 mins), standard washing (40 mins), powerful washing (50 mins), fruit and vegetable washing, and automatic air drying function. It’s also Ideal for washing baby products. 【NOTE】In order to ensure that the dishwasher can be used normally, the supplier will conduct a test before delivery, so if you find a small amount of water stains in the dishwasher after receiving the package, please don't worry, it’s not an used one ❤【AUTOMATIC WATER FILLING, ADAPTER INCLUDED】This dishwasher is an upgraded version. The adapter is suitable for faucets with a diameter less than 24MM. The hose can be attached to the washing machine faucet(1/2 faucet) without the adapter. The automatic water supply saves you the trouble and time of pouring water by yourself, and it is very convenient for the elderly, so it is an ideal gift for parents.【GIFT: a roll of tape for leaking prevention】 ❤【AUTOMATIC 167℉ HOT AIR DRYING】After finishing the washing cycle, the dishwasher will automatically dry the tableware by 167℉ hot air, which could effectively keep your tableware dry and avoid breeding odor, so you can store the tableware in the dishwasher as if it were in a cupboard ❤【360° ALL-ROUND STRONG WASHING】The power of this dishwasher is 1200W, and the working water pressure is 0.04MPa-1MPa, so its powerful motor and S-shaped rotary sprayer can effectively remove stains on tableware. This dishwasher can automatically heat water to 162°F, because water has the best effect on dissolving grease at 162°F, and would not damage the tableware, which is more energy-saving and can inactivate harmful substances ❤【COMPACT SIZE, LARGE CAPACITY】The external size of this dishwasher is 17.7(L)*16(W)*17.7(H), but the inside can accommodate 14-20 pieces of tableware. It's ideal to be placed on the countertop or in the built-in cabinet. Space-saving. No need for installation ❤【WATER SAVING】This dishwasher consumes 2.38 gallons (9L) for washing dishes, 1.58 gallons (6L) for washing fruits and vegetables, which can saves you more than half of the water bill as it may take more than 5.28 gallons (20L) of water to wash the dishes once by hand","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hv6mgwnVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LemoHome","source_asin":"B0BJVK25QP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJVK25QP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJVK25QP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
