window.products.push({"id":100155,"name":"AprilAire 5844 Humidifier Installation Kit for AprilAire Whole Home Humidifiers with Automatic Control, Compatible with AprilAire Humidifier Models: 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.81,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L2RBJ1j2L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This AprilAire 5844Z Humidifier Installation Kit contains all components for step-by-step installation of an AprilAire Whole Home Humidifier with Automatic Control, Models 400, 500, 600. Convenient kit saves you time and money over purchasing supplies individually.AprilAire introduced the first evaporative humidifier for forced air furnace systems back in 1954. Since that time, AprilAire continues to lead the industry in whole home humidification systems. Our evaporative humidifiers work by piping water into the distribution tray located at the top of the humidifier. The water is uniformly distributed across the width of the tray and through a scientifically designed system of outlets. It flows by gravity over the Water Panel evaporator. Dry, hot air from the HVAC system moves through the moisture-laden Water Panel evaporator. Natural evaporation takes place, meaning the water is turned to vapor, and the humidified air is circulated throughout your home.WHAT'S IN THE BOX?25-feet of 18/2 Thermostat Wire10-feet of 18/2 Thermostat Wire10-feet of 18/5 Thermostat Wire(4) Twist-On Wire Nut Connectors25-feet of 1/4-inch OD Supply Tube10-feet of 1/2-inch ID Drain Tube5/8-inch Hose Clamp6-inch Round Duct Collar2-feet of 6-inch Round Flex Duct(4) #8 x 3/4-inch Self-Drilling Screws","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L2RBJ1j2L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aprilaire","source_asin":"B08CS4DMQR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CS4DMQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CS4DMQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
