window.products.push({"id":100199,"name":"Daystar, Jeep XJ Cherokee Side Hood Vent Kit, reduce under hood temperature, black pair, fits MJ Comanche 1986 to 1992 and XJ Cherokee 1984 to 2001 2/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":145.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FJMyFbcRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jeep Cherokee XJ & Comanche MJ owners have always suffered from excessive under hood heat. Daystar Products comes to the rescue with our new fully functional side hood vents for the 1984-2001 Jeep Cherokee XJ, and the 1986-1992 Jeep Comanche MJ. These new hood vents will not only give your Jeep a great look, but will help to keep your under hood temperatures down. Structural integrity of the hood remains intact. Template provided for easy installation. Reduces under hood temperatures. Proudly made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FJMyFbcRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daystar","source_asin":"B00NZ7KTOM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NZ7KTOM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NZ7KTOM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":100200,"name":"Pulluty 316048413 and 316048414 Chrome Stove Burner Drip Pan Set for Frigidaire Tappan Kenmore Electric Range with Locking Slot, Includes 2 6-Inch and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iTp71BELL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality chrome plated steel Includes 2 x 316048414 (6'' chrome GE burner drip pans) measuring 7.5\" in diameter and 2 x 316048413 (8'' GE chrome oven burner drip pans) measuring 9.3\" in diameter. The electric oven drip pans are made of durable chrome plated steel with environmentally friendly plating technology. Silver color. 6\" 316048414 and 8\" 316048413 electric ovens fit most Ken-more, Tappan, Fri-gidaire, Cro-sley, White-Westinghouse inset electric stove tops. The chrome stove top drip tray fits the stove properly and prevents the drip tray element from wobbling, thus preventing the cookware from shaking on the stove. If your old drip tray is dirty or rusty, this replacement will fix it and make your stove look like new. 316048413 Stove burner pan replacements:316048403, 5301317238, 5303013588, 5303285960, 5303935054, A316221201, K001307596, AP2124664, etc. 316048414 Electric stove burner drip pan replacements. 316221101, 316221301, 5303013589, 5303205285, 5303206604, 5308005369, 5308011440, A316221101, P062005, etc. Installation precautions: Prevent burns. Before installing the drip tray of the electric stove, wait until its surface has cooled to a certain level. Electric stove drip tray speeds up cooking time and saves energy costs. The chrome-plated electric stove burner drip tray catches spills (oil/drips/food) from cookware on the burner during cooking. And ensures that nothing drips onto the flame and stays safe. The burner drip tray is also easy to clean with a cloth, paper towel, soap or in the dishwasher. If you are not sure if the drip tray is right for you, please contact us and we will be happy to help you. Please do not hesitate to contact us. We will do our best to satisfy each and every customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iTp71BELL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pulluty","source_asin":"B08V8GZH51","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V8GZH51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V8GZH51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
