window.products.push({"id":100203,"name":"Moccha 3.4cu ft. Compact Refrigerator, Fridge Freezer w/Double Doors, 7 Levels Thermostat, Quiet Mini Fridge for Kitchen, Dorm, Apartment, Bar, Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eAf2ciy9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🍧Compact Size for Small Space : The dimension of the ‎17.5 x 17 x 38.5 inches, which features compact design. So it is convenient for storage and will not occupy much space, which is very suitable for using in small spaces such as dormitory, office, small apartment and so on. 🍧Adjustable Feet & Removable Glass Shelves: Featuring height adjustable feet, this mini fridge for bedroom is available for keeping stable on any floor and preventing shaking when using. Along with two removable internal glass shelves to meet the demands of different sizes of food, it is more useful in life. 🍧LED Lighting & Adjustable Temperature: When the refrigerator is opened, the internal LED light will automatically turn on to help you better check the food situation. Manual thermostat is simple to operate. And there are 7 levels of adjustable temperature to meet your different needs. High-quality compressor can quickly cool the refrigerator and ensure quiet operation. 🍧Double Door with Freezer: Classic double door configuration allows you to take foods quickly and easily. And the tight sealing strip locks the interior with the outside air to ensure stable temperature. Separately equipped with a freezer compartment, it has more functions and keeps your food fresh for a long time comparing with ordinary mini refrigerators. 🍧Spacious Classified Storage Space: 3.4cuft storage space is sufficient to store all kinds of food. Besides, two compartments are designed to help sort and store different foods. The upper freezer area is used for placing perishable items, while the lower fridge which has vegetable box and side shelves is used for putting vegetables, fruits and drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eAf2ciy9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LDAILY","source_asin":"B08LB84GCG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LB84GCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LB84GCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
