window.products.push({"id":100390,"name":"Strong Refrigerator Stand Washer Dryer Stand Moving Dolly Rollers with 4 Adjustable Feet and 8 Locking Rubber Casters Wheels for Fridge Washing Machin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fIN7PwtnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Features - Ultra-strong rigidness, press resistance and anti-corrosion.- Effectively reduce the washing machine vibration and noise.- Durable, sturdy, adjustable dimension and convenient movement.- Easily adjust the sturdy poles to suit the larger furniture.- Maintaining ventilation of the bottom, anti-rust and easy to be moved. Moving has never been easier - 8 Rubber Locking Swivel Wheels: Make moving heavy objects easy and ensure your furniture will not roll.- 4 Adjustable Strong Feet: You can adjust the height of mobile base to suitable height by rotating petal shaped object on each feet.Strong stability can prevent the washing machine from shaking violently during use and preventing noise. Specification - Color: Red- Weight Capacity: 500 lbs- Maximum Width: 27.5 inches- Maximum Length: 27.5 inches- Minimum Width: 18 inches- Minimum Length: 19.5 inches- The Height of 8 Wheels: 4.3 inches- The Height of 4 Feet: 3.94 - 5.12 inches Package - 8 x Lock Rubber Wheels- 4 x Adjustable Strong Feet- 4 x Anti-skid Pads- 4 x Double-layer Structure Poles- 1x Screwdriver- 16 x Screws- 1 x Installation Instructions Installation 1. Connect the triangle bases with the connecting tubes.2. Move the connecting tubes to adjust the size of the base.3. Adjust the connecting tubes in the center through the holes on the back.4. Fix the size by pressing the button lock.5. Adjust the height by twisting the lower ring on the feet.6. Put the base flat and check if the spirit level is in center.7. Fix the height by twisting the upper ring on the feet.8. Stabilize the base by pressing down the button lock on the wheels. Note If you put more than 500 lbs weight, the cute dolly will be broken.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fIN7PwtnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allesin","source_asin":"B07TZ4J5FH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TZ4J5FH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TZ4J5FH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
