window.products.push({"id":100616,"name":"W10837240 Maytag Dryer Idler Pulley Whirlpool Kenmore Assembly Part WED5600XW0 MEDB835DW4 WED8000DW4 WED9150WW1 WED8500DC0 WED5550XW0 WED9500TW3 WED55","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5103aMF4XHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Maytag Dryer Idler Pulley W10837240 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP5988716, W10547287, W10547290, 3387372, 3388674, 4337602, PS11726337, W10118754, W10118756, W10837240VP. W10837240 Dryer Idler Pulley assembly is compatible with Whirlpool, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Inglis, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Maytag appliances. Kenmore Dryer Parts W10837240 is responsible for keeping tension on the dryer belt, which allows it to rotate the drum of the dryer during the drying cycle. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Kenmore Dryer Idler Pulley W10837240 will help if your appliance is noisy, doesn't tumble, doesn't start. The replacing process is simple and requires only basic tools. It is important to ensure that the dryer is unplugged from the electrical outlet before attempting any repairs or replacements. 💡 Whirlpool Dryer Idler Pulley W10837240 is constructed of high-quality materials to ensure durability and longevity. W10837240 Pulley has a durable metal construction with a smooth surface to reduce friction and prevent belt wear and tear. It also has a spring-loaded mechanism to maintain the proper belt tension and prevent slipping during operation. Whirlpool Idler Pulley W10837240 meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Can you use the dryer with a bad idler pulley? Operating a dryer with a faulty idler pulley is not advisable. A faulty idler pulley can cause significant damage to other parts of the dryer, such as the belt and motor, if left unaddressed. In addition, a bad idler pulley can also create a safety hazard, such as a potential fire risk due to excessive friction and heat. It's recommended to replace the faulty idler pulley as soon as possible to avoid further damage or safety concerns. 💡 Popular Models: med6630hw1, med7100dc0, medb765fw0, medb835dc4, medb835dw3, medb835dw4, medb855dc3, mede500vw1, medx500xw0, medx700xw0, mgdb835dw4, wed5500xw0, wed5550xw0, wed5700xl0, wed7500gc0, wed8000dw1, wed8000dw3, wed8000dw4, wed8300sw2, wed8500dc0, wed8500dc1, wed8500dc3, wed8500dc4, wed9150ww0, wed9150ww1, wed9200sq0, wed9200sq1, wed9400sw1, wed9400sw2, wed9500tw2, wed9500tw3, wed9550wl0, wed9550ww1, wed9600ta1, wgd5500xw1, wgd72hedw0, wgd8500dc4, wgd8500dr3, wgd9550ww2, wgd95hedw0.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5103aMF4XHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07YFFVWG2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YFFVWG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YFFVWG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
