window.products.push({"id":100710,"name":"AGM73269501 Washer Water Inlet Valve Filter Screen by Techecook - Compatible for L-G Ken-more Washing Machine - Replaces 1810261, AP5202486, PS3618281","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719mUH-HVOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Strong & Durable ABS ✅【ITEM SPECIALITY & DURABLE】This water inlet valve screen (part number AGM73269501) is for washers. AGM73269501 washing machine filter screen attaches inside the inlet valve to prevent large sediment from getting into the washer. Washer water screen AGM73269501 can filter out sediments and particles as water enters your washing machine. If the Washer inlet valve filter clog up, water drips in slowly or not at all, making it impossible to get laundry done. Replace AGM73269501 l/g washer inlet screen to solve your problem ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES】Includes 2 X hot water washer inlet filter and 2 X cold water filter screens. Blue for Cold water, Orange for Hot. You can use either the blue or the orange water inlet valve screen as they are identical except for the color of the plastic. Especially the old cold water filter is clogged with calcium deposits, sand and other things will affect the performance of the washing machine. Please replace it with a new one in time and helps to maximize the water flow rate and performance of your washing machine ✅【180-DAYS WARRANTY】During the warranty period, if the AGM73269501 washer water inlet valve filter screen has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately. These washing machine water inlet screens will help to keep the water clean and clear, preventing any dirt, rust or sediment from entering the washer tub and potentially clogging up the valve and hoses ✅【COMPATIBLE MODEL】AGM73269501 washer water screen fit for L/G ,Ken-more , Ken-more Elite washing machine. ►Maytag washer water inlet valve filter screen replaces part numbers：1810261, AP5202486, PS3618281, EAP3618281. ►The washing machine water inlet screens is durable and not easy to deform. Applicable symptoms: Water doesn’t enter the washer, Wediment enters the washer, Damaged/broken Water Inlet Valve Filter Screen ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】Disconnect the power and shut off the water supply before installing this l/g washer screen filter. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. AGM73269501 whirl-pool washer inlet filter is made of quality ABS, durable and reusable; Suggest use these ABS screen instead of the rubber gasket type with molded in steel mesh screen which rust and corrodes after several years of use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719mUH-HVOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08W5212FB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W5212FB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W5212FB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
