window.products.push({"id":100813,"name":"Portable Washing Machine, Full-Automatic Washer Compact Laundry Machine and Dryer Combo, Built-in Pump Drain, 6.6lbs Capacity, LED Display, ideal Laun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A5CRbOZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Small Portable Washing Machine – This Globest washing machine is compact and lightweight, so you can easily move it in your house. It is able to be stored easily, ideal for camping trips and RVs, apartments, boats or dormitories, perfect choice for small households with limited space and minimal optimal. Convenient Design - This full-automatic washer features a clear lid design, so you can view and monitor water levels and wash conditions. The honeycomb shaped stainless steel inner tub can load 6.6 lbs at one time and wash many clothes for you. With lint filter, water inlet and drain pump, you can easily drain dirty water. Easy & Convenient to Use - 8 Programs for choosing:Normal, Cotton, Gentle, Speed Wash, Spin, Whites, Heavy Soil, Tub Clean. With 3 water level: Large, medium and small. Control the Wash, Rinse, and Spin cycles with the push of a button. You can also adjust the water level based on load size. Once you've set up the wash program, you can leave it alone to work. It will relieve your hands and you can use the time to do other things. Automatic Balance - For washing machines, imbalance can be a very serious problem. This can cause the washer to \"dance on the floor\" or even leak water and damage your floor. Globest Full-Automatic washing machines have an automatic unbalance detection function, it's able to automatically fix the unbalance issue through allowing more water to come in. Child Protection - Our washing machine comes equipped with 2-24 hour intelligent delay washing function(start at a later time),run and wash cycle at your convenience,even if you are not at home. Also, our washer has child lock function.Once child lock function is set, all buttons are locked and the machine stops run and error alarms. Relief Your Hands - This product is no installation need and easy to operate. It won't take you much time and could take convenience to you. If you have any problem, please contact us, our customer service will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A5CRbOZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GloBest","source_asin":"B093BN7FV7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-100813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093BN7FV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B093BN7FV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
